            "`push(value)` moves the value in",
            "`pop()` moves it back out as `Option<T>`"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "You cannot move out of `v[0]` — E0507",
            "Use `remove`, `swap_remove` or `drain`",
            "Or `std::mem::take` / `std::mem::replace`"
          ]
